! RT02 初期状態 (FNF TS・昨日 監視チームが FNF を導入した直後の状態)
interface Loopback0
 ip address 71.71.71.71 255.255.255.255
!
flow record REC-CORP
 match ipv4 source address
 match ipv4 destination address
 match ipv4 protocol
 match transport destination-port
 collect counter bytes
 collect counter packets
!
flow exporter EXP-CORP
 destination 203.0.113.243
 source Loopback0
 transport udp 2055
 export-protocol ipfix
!
flow monitor MON-CORP
 record REC-CORP
 exporter EXP-CORP
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description === to RT01 (customer traffic in) ===
 ip address 10.30.219.2 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description === to RT03 (upstream) ===
 ip address 10.30.220.1 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
!
router ospf 1
 router-id 71.71.71.71
 network 71.71.71.71 0.0.0.0 area 0
 network 10.30.219.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 10.30.220.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
!
